{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "Christmas felt like a natural next choice because several of my recent interactions were with explicitly Christmas-themed albums.",
    "That recommendation recognized a specific listening interest that gives me a reason to choose another album."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Glen Campbell: Greatest Hits offers a country hits collection when I am currently more interested in Christmas music.",
    "Titles such as ICON, Stages and The Very Best Of give me too little evidence of a connection to my listening interests to motivate me to try them.",
    "A concert album does not appeal to me simply because it is music; I want a clearer connection to the holiday listening I have enjoyed."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The choices seemed to treat interest in a few albums as interest in a broad range of music.",
    "Greatest-hits collections seemed to be treated as appealing on their own, but I need to know whose music they contain and why it fits my interests."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My repeated interactions with Christmas albums, including The Classic Christmas Album twice, provide a stronger reason for my choices than a general interest in albums.",
    "My latest interaction was The New Old Fashioned, so my history is not exclusively Christmas listening, but that does not mean unfamiliar albums automatically appeal to me.",
    "I rarely choose something without a clear reason to expect it will fit what I want to hear."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly recognized my Christmas listening interest but extended it too broadly to albums with no clear connection to what I want."
}"}
